IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ha88-types`
IMPORT `ha88-possession`
IMPORT `ha88-damages`
IMPORT `ha88-goal`

-- Housing Act 1988 (UK) — the encoder's tests. Expected values are worked
-- by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

old MEANS `before the Renters' Rights Act 2025`

GIVEN served IS A DATE, gs IS A LIST OF `Ground kind`
GIVETH A `Section 8 notice`
`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` served `on grounds` gs MEANS
    `Section 8 notice` OF old, served, gs, FALSE, served, served, NOTHING, served

GIVEN served IS A DATE, ntq IS A DATE, gs IS A LIST OF `Ground kind`
GIVETH A `Section 8 notice`
`a periodic s 8 notice served` served `, notice to quit date` ntq `, on grounds` gs MEANS
    `Section 8 notice` OF old, served, gs, TRUE, ntq, served, NOTHING, served

jan15 MEANS Date 15 1 2026

§§ `Goal 1 — section 8 notices`

-- (4B): two weeks.
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `another ground`)) EQUALS Date 29 1 2026
-- (4): Ground 14, the date of service.
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `Ground 14`, `a ground listed in s 8(4A)`)) EQUALS jan15
-- (4A): two months; for a periodic tenancy not before the notice-to-quit
-- date.
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `a ground listed in s 8(4A)`)) EQUALS Date 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a periodic s 8 notice served` jan15 `, notice to quit date` (Date 28 2 2026) `, on grounds` (LIST `a ground listed in s 8(4A)`)) EQUALS Date 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a periodic s 8 notice served` jan15 `, notice to quit date` (Date 31 3 2026) `, on grounds` (LIST `a ground listed in s 8(4A)`, `another ground`)) EQUALS Date 31 3 2026
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` (Date 31 12 2025) `on grounds` (LIST `a ground listed in s 8(4A)`)) EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
-- (3A): Ground 7A.
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `Ground 7A`, `Ground 14`)) EQUALS Date 15 2 2026
#ASSERT `the earliest date for proceedings under` (`a periodic s 8 notice served` jan15 `, notice to quit date` (Date 20 2 2026) `, on grounds` (LIST `Ground 7A`)) EQUALS Date 20 2 2026
-- (3)(c): twelve months from service.
#ASSERT `the latest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `another ground`)) EQUALS Date 15 1 2027
#ASSERT `the latest date for proceedings under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` (Date 29 2 2024) `on grounds` (LIST `another ground`)) EQUALS Date 28 2 2025

-- (4C)-(4F): Ground 7A service windows.
GIVEN served IS A DATE, k IS A `Ground 7A condition`, trigger IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Section 8 notice`
`a 7A notice served` served `, condition` k `, trigger` trigger MEANS
    `Section 8 notice` OF old, served, (LIST `Ground 7A`), FALSE, served, served, JUST k, trigger

#ASSERT `a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` (`a 7A notice served` (Date 9 3 2026) `, condition` `condition 1, 3 or 5 (conviction)` `, trigger` (Date 10 3 2025))
#ASSERT NOT (`a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` (`a 7A notice served` (Date 10 3 2026) `, condition` `condition 1, 3 or 5 (conviction)` `, trigger` (Date 10 3 2025)))
#ASSERT `a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` (`a 7A notice served` (Date 30 1 2026) `, condition` `condition 4 (closure order)` `, trigger` (Date 31 10 2025))
#ASSERT NOT (`a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` (`a 7A notice served` (Date 31 1 2026) `, condition` `condition 4 (closure order)` `, trigger` (Date 31 10 2025)))
#ASSERT `a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` (`a fixed-term s 8 notice served` jan15 `on grounds` (LIST `another ground`))

§§ `Goal 2 — section 21 notices`

GIVEN periodic IS A BOOLEAN, given IS A DATE, specified IS A DATE, ntq IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Section 21 notice`
`a s 21 notice, periodic` periodic `, given` given `, specifying` specified `, notice to quit date` ntq MEANS
    `Section 21 notice` OF Date 1 2 2025, periodic, given, specified, ntq, FALSE

-- The four months beginning 1 February 2025 end 31 May 2025.
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` FALSE `, given` (Date 31 5 2025) `, specifying` (Date 31 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 31 5 2025)))
#ASSERT `the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` FALSE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 1 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 1 6 2025))
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` FALSE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 31 7 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 1 6 2025)))
-- (4)(b): periodic, not before the notice-to-quit date.
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` TRUE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 1 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 15 8 2025)))
#ASSERT `the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` TRUE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 15 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 15 8 2025))
-- (4C): a tenancy arising under s 5(2).
#ASSERT `the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` (`Section 21 notice` OF Date 1 2 2025, TRUE, Date 1 3 2025, Date 1 5 2025, Date 1 4 2025, TRUE)
-- (4D): six months beginning 1 June 2025 end 30 November 2025; (4E): four
-- months beginning 15 August 2025 end 14 December 2025.
#ASSERT `the last day for s 21 proceedings under` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` FALSE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 1 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 1 6 2025)) EQUALS Date 30 11 2025
#ASSERT `the last day for s 21 proceedings under` (`a s 21 notice, periodic` TRUE `, given` (Date 1 6 2025) `, specifying` (Date 15 8 2025) `, notice to quit date` (Date 15 8 2025)) EQUALS Date 14 12 2025

§§ `Goal 3 — damages for unlawful eviction`

-- Fields: occurred, deprived, harassed, reinstated, belief, grounds, with,
-- without, reduction.
evicted MEANS `Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 200000, 260000, 10000
#ASSERT `the landlord is liable under s 27 for` evicted
#ASSERT `the statutory damages for` evicted EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `the statutory damages for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 200000, 260000, 0) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the statutory damages for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, 200000, 260000, 0) EQUALS 0
-- Reasonable grounds answer harassment only.
#ASSERT NOT (`the landlord is liable under s 27 for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, 200000, 260000, 0))
#ASSERT `the landlord is liable under s 27 for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, 200000, 260000, 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`the landlord is liable under s 27 for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 9 6 1988, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 200000, 260000, 0))
#ASSERT `the statutory damages for` (`Eviction facts` OF Date 1 1 2020, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 200000, 260000, 70000) EQUALS 0

§§ `The top-level goal`

amended MEANS `Section 8 notice` OF `as amended by the Renters' Rights Act 2025`, jan15, (LIST `another ground`), FALSE, jan15, jan15, NOTHING, jan15
pos MEANS `the possession position for` (`Possession case` OF JUST amended, NOTHING, JUST evicted)
#ASSERT pos's `earliest date for s 8 proceedings` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT pos's `latest date for s 8 proceedings` EQUALS JUST (Date 15 1 2027)
#ASSERT pos's `statutory damages` EQUALS JUST 50000
#ASSERT pos's `last day for s 21 proceedings` EQUALS NOTHING
